==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*suuttudak}}, probably derived from early {{der|fi|sla-pro||*sūtu}} (later {{l|sla-pro|*sytъ}}). Alternatively from {{suffix|fi|suu|ttua}}. Compare {{m|fi|suivaantua}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation|suuttua*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive}} to get [[angry]] {{+obj|fi|all<at>}}

